[{"title":"何日","author":"刘崧","text":"杨叶落尽桑叶稀，乌鹊夜啼风掩扉。\n长年塞北风霜早，何日江南游子归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋意","author":"刘崧","text":"帘外纤尘寂不惊，满庭秋意坐来清。\n閒门白日无人过，犬吠阶前落叶声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月对菊","author":"刘崧","text":"杏梨三月斗芳华，不见深冬梅与茶。\n欲识幽燕风景异，菊花开后更无花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狂风","author":"刘崧","text":"陟顿风来刮地吹，排窗推户更掀帷。\n居民土壁围烟火，暖坑敧眠自不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜","author":"刘崧","text":"马龁枯荄寒夜长，风如箭镞射阴房。\n不知门外三更雪，误起开门看月光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮戏柬天英上人","author":"刘崧","text":"残年寄食尚天涯，风裂禅衣面扑沙。\n还忆故山晴雪里，閒拖锡杖看梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题栈阁晴峰图","author":"刘崧","text":"曾闻剑阁上青天，栈道萦纡路几千。\n更过陇头听流水，白云西下自秦川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"刘崧","text":"九华日照绿杨川，三峡云深瀑布泉。\n安得草衣骑白鹿，碧桃花底访神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月承叔铭佥宪二绝句问西厅牡丹开未并寄罂粟令予种之以娱目因戏用韵以荅之 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"惆怅乘骢客未回，杏花落尽牡丹开。\n西厅吏散文书静，几向花阴立紫苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月承叔铭佥宪二绝句问西厅牡丹开未并寄罂粟令予种之以娱目因戏用韵以荅之 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"囊盛罂粟寄来迟，种得花开定几时。\n赖有戎葵高一丈，浅红深绿总宜诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"既四月末予西轩牡丹一枝最后开与戎葵掩映特盛时叔铭适自保定归隐若有相待之意因命酌快赏叔铭再用前绝句韵为寄兴不能已仍用韵奉荅并忆吕本拙佥宪按事中山未还归日当共一笑云","author":"刘崧","text":"戎葵花早牡丹迟，刚值先生下马时。\n不便破除千斛酒，也应勾引数篇诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"既四月末予西轩牡丹一枝最后开与戎葵掩映特盛时叔铭适自保定归隐若有相待之意因命酌快赏叔铭再用前绝句韵为寄兴不能已仍用韵奉荅并忆吕本拙佥宪按事中山未还归日当共一笑云","author":"刘崧","text":"有客邯郸久未回，西厅无奈好花开。\n当筵纵赏何由共，日日开轩扫翠苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叔铭以纨扇索予题诗因戏作丛竹于上仍系以诗","author":"刘崧","text":"家住江南青竹林，别来无日不关心。\n偶然写向齐纨上，便欲移床坐绿阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题古木幽篁图","author":"刘崧","text":"琼枝翠叶静为邻，秀色娟娟绝点尘。\n日暮天寒罗袖薄，可怜空谷有佳人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日见雁有感","author":"刘崧","text":"居庸关前秋草新，桑乾河畔是通津。\n可怜无数沙场雁，个个南飞背着人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别叔铭佥宪出顺承门","author":"刘崧","text":"送客出城秋已凉，太行南上楚天长。\n顺承门外斜阳里，荞麦花开似故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题晦庵先生书耕云钓月四大字墨本为王敬之知事赋","author":"刘崧","text":"十角黄牛两具犁，山南山北趁幽栖。\n杏花开后菖蒲出，春雨鹁鸠相应啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题晦庵先生书耕云钓月四大字墨本为王敬之知事赋","author":"刘崧","text":"独移兰棹钓沧湾，风细波澄夜景閒。\n却渡九溪歌九曲，不知月上浸亭山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月一日得大兄去年九月寄书来其午魏直夫来自京师闻大兄哀讣而未领家问是夕灯下且信且疑辄赋绝句以写悲怆","author":"刘崧","text":"西风和雨入长杨，的的青灯伴夜长。\n一纸乡书三四读，不知清泪湿衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿雄县东馆会文学李秀士自云尝从游圭斋欧阳文公过临川曾子固清江胡居敬二先辈之门其风流酝藉有足观者于是予去乡七年矣为之慨然明日书此识别","author":"刘崧","text":"瓦桥东馆晚停骖，喜遇幽人慰盍簪。\n间说从游往年事，满庭霜月梦江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出雄县望西山赋一绝寄吕继道佥宪","author":"刘崧","text":"顺承关外酒阑时，驻马相看各自悲。\n多谢青山三百里，送人直过易河西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望汉献王陵","author":"刘崧","text":"单家桥下雪横冰，草树连云掠冻鹰。\n汉业已荒河水在，行人遥指献王陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿逯家店","author":"刘崧","text":"柴门下马日平低，苇席蓬窗壁乍泥。\n寒夜老翁看客惯，青钱问酒过村西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入德州界","author":"刘崧","text":"霜结沙尘冻不飞，榆林风定日熹微。\n客程已入山东境，渐喜居人识面稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89